@startuml
title Boot Artifact Dependency Graph

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

component "OpenSBI\ncomponent" as OpenSBI
artifact "fw_dynamic.bin" as FwDynamic

component "U-Boot\ncomponent" as UBoot
artifact "u-boot-spl.bin" as UBootSpl
artifact "u-boot.itb" as UBootItb

component "Linux\ncomponent" as Linux
artifact "Image.gz" as Image
artifact "hifive-unmatched-a00.dtb" as Dtb

component "Boot Partition\nartifact set" as BootSet

OpenSBI --> FwDynamic : produces
FwDynamic --> UBoot : consumed by
UBoot --> UBootSpl : produces
UBoot --> UBootItb : produces
Linux --> Image : produces
Linux --> Dtb : produces

UBootSpl --> BootSet : required
UBootItb --> BootSet : required
Image --> BootSet : required
Dtb --> BootSet : required

note right of BootSet
The SD boot set depends on both
U-Boot and Linux artifacts. Linux
does not depend on U-Boot at build time.
end note

@enduml

